<title>USA: Bio-Plexus to sell needle containers.</title>
<headline>Bio-Plexus to sell needle containers.</headline>
<dateline>TOLLAND, Conn. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bio-Plexus Inc said Tuesday it had received approval from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration to market the Bio-Plexus Needle Disposal Container.</p>
<p>The company said this product coordinates with Bio-Plexus Punctur-Guard needles and Drop-It holders for safe needle disposal.  Sales of the Needle Disposal Container will begin immediately.</p>
</text>
